 "真是會說笑^^", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbYj1NHkq30", "created_at": "2026-07-29 09:37:12", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841425834093457", "author_name": "布娜飛比利時啤酒餐廳", "comment_id": "17864265519648775", "comment_text": "這篇很適合先收藏，臨時要約朋友吃飯時，有「可以聊天、不趕人、選擇多」的地方會省很多時間。", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbYTvtiGjFr", "created_at": "2026-07-29 07:16:39", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841469567133845", "author_name": "Jack｜健身教練🏉", "comment_id": "17941608564293140", "comment_text": "你是說我本人嗎？", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbX5JqKmD8d", "created_at": "2026-07-29 03:24:16", "error": null, "like_count": 1, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 1}, {"author_id": "17841477358207737", "author_name": "劉敏瑋", "comment_id": "18084034205422149", "comment_text": "？", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbXfDoYk7vn", "created_at": "2026-07-28 23:36:15", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841476660608890", "author_name": "🩵", "comment_id": "18402533923091051", "comment_text": "我愛你▓", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbWWwkgk2X-", "created_at": "2026-07-28 13:04:30", "error": null, "like_count": 1, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841443175040698", "author_name": "沸鼎紅 麻辣火鍋", "comment_id": "18108598835084398", "comment_text": "沸鼎紅來自薦啦🙋‍♀️ 雖然我是新開幕的餐廳，不過來吃過的朋友們都會一直再訪🤗\n\n延續麻神麻辣火鍋可以喝的麻辣湯，乾隆皇帝御膳房養生的何首烏雞湯，胡椒香氣濃郁暖胃的胡椒豬肚湯，還有吃得到蔬果鮮甜的昆布湯，原塊肉品新鮮現切，翠綠蔬菜好吃丸餃，期待您蒞臨品嚐😋\n\n我們麻辣湯底熬煮的過程中沒有放任何的動物性食材，溫潤順口可以喝的麻辣湯，還有超好吃的果凍鴨血～ （鍋底不加鴨血的話是五辛素，有吃素的朋友也可以吃唷～\n\n晚上10:30後進入chill模式，燈光音樂風格轉換，屬於自己的微醺時間，不想吃太飽還有一人份宵夜私房餐～", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbUTE4ekyqJ", "created_at": "2026-07-27 17:53:50", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841463208433843", "author_name": "子靜｜✨ 食。衣。生活", "comment_id": "18605188090011506", "comment_text": "哈", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbRlGfpE_qW", "created_at": "2026-07-26 16:33:37", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841463257461721", "author_name": "蘇 菲 雅 S O P H I A", "comment_id": "18056068631583990", "comment_text": "留自己看 上次沒發揮好 這次要好好發揮", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbQz5yaiR_2", "created_at": "2026-07-26 09:23:43", "error": null, "like_count": 2, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 1}, {"author_id": "17841475293757932", "author_name": "吃貨地圖日記", "comment_id": "18019220831910782", "comment_text": "我私心偏愛那種沒招牌、老闆記得你上次點什麼的巷弄小店，這串根本口袋名單寶庫，默默跟著筆記了", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbQEiHBGvYE", "created_at": "2026-07-26 02:29:48", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841414091746468", "author_name": "陳潔", "comment_id": "18104761663890925", "comment_text": "十年前在文化大學好漢坡開東坡滷味，因被硬漲店租而撤離，後來轉移至蘆洲三民高中旁……疫情前就休息至今……承蒙當初文大學子厚愛以及蘆洲老饕關愛，時常詢問是否要再開……\n如今！如今！如今！\n四川正宗多工序麻辣中藥原汁原味再現！！！老味道，新組合！！！\n\n石牌商圈夜市，四兩三 鹹水雞。\n正宗四川21道中藥煉製，\n每日直送低溫保鮮，\n：+：原文化東坡滷味：+：\n絕無分店！\n辣度客制化、也可純香不辣唷～\n真的很唰嘴～\n歲月不饒人，一晃眼……\n無論人在哪？還是懷念老味道\n各位大學畢業出社會的脆友們\n什麼味道能讓您邊吃邊回憶學生時光？\n歡迎投入社會的文大老學子們回訪\n更歡迎愛嚐試美食新組合的脆友們\n來店品嚐並指教……感激感恩", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbPmn3_lCWP", "created_at": "2026-07-25 22:08:26", "error": null, "like_count": 0, "platform": "THREADS", "post_id": "18113719412301018", "reply_count": 0}, {"author_id": "17841468229080565", "author_name": "Hsuan👻", "comment_id": "17942813430260797", "comment_text": "存", "comment_url": "https://www.threads.net/t/DbO00ATkgbt", "created_at": "2026-07-25 14:53:11", "error": null, "like_count":